  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðeah æt stæltyhtlan lad teorie Ængliscan oððe Wiliscan, gylde angyldes þæt he mid beléd wæs: ðæs oðres gyldes nan ðing ne ðæs wites ðe ma.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If an Englishman or Welshman fails to exculpate himself in a charge of theft, he must [only] pay a simple replacement for what he was charged with [stealing]; further fines or compensations are not to be paid.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Licet in furti compellatione lada deficiat Anglico uel Walisco, reddat angildes unde fuerat accusatus: de alio gildo nichil reddat uel de wita.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
